os/evildarkarchon/jbsa/deployments","created_at":"2026-09-02T07:31:02Z","updated_at":"2026-09-03T06:04:35Z","pushed_at":"2026-09-08T10:32:48Z","git_url":"git://github.com/evildarkarchon/jbsa.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:evildarkarchon/jbsa.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/evildarkarchon/jbsa.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/evildarkarchon/jbsa","homepage":null,"size":13196,"stargazers_count":0,"watchers_count":0,"language":null,"has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":false,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":0,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":22,"license":null,"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":[],"visibility":"public","forks":0,"open_issues":22,"watchers":0,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":true,"maintain":true,"push":true,"triage":true,"pull":true}},"body":"## Objective\n\nMake independent authorship, fixture rights, dependency/native provenance, notices, SBOM generation, and release-input inspection enforceable from the first implementation commit.\n\n## Planning context\n\nThis is a child of [Implement and qualify the Java 25 Bethesda archive library and BSArch-compatible CLI](https://github.com/evildarkarchon/jbsa/issues/23). It implements the accepted sequence and gates recorded in [Choose the implementation sequence and specification release gates](https://github.com/evildarkarchon/jbsa/issues/17) under [Specify the Java 25 Bethesda archive library and BSArch-compatible CLI](https://github.com/evildarkarchon/jbsa/issues/1).\n\nBefore implementation begins, trace this issue to the exact permanent requirements in docs/spec/requirements.yaml. Expected namespaces:\n\n- JBSA-LIC-*\n- JBSA-DIST-*\n\n## Acceptance\n\n- Add Apache-2.0 LICENSE and NOTICE materials plus the CC0-1.0 synthetic-fixture policy and required SPDX/REUSE metadata.\n- Document and enforce the prohibition on copied, mechanically translated, or structure-preserving adaptation from the Reference Snapshot.\n- Create maintained dependency and native-byte inventories with license, source, version, checksum, notice, and redistribution evidence.\n- Generate an SBOM and required notices and prevent proprietary/local fixtures, unapproved native payloads, and ambiguous artifacts from entering release inputs.\n- Document the DCO path for external contributions and make unclear rights, branding, EULA, patent, or provenance evidence a stop-before-merge or release condition.\n\n## Ownership\n\nAgent-driven when unblocked and labelled ready-for-agent.\n\n## Non-goals\n\n- Do not expand this issue beyond its independently mergeable outcome or bypass a native blocker relationship.\n- Never modify the pinned TES5Edit Reference Snapshot or commit proprietary/local game assets.\n- Do not add GUI behavior, non-Windows guarantees, Maven Central/GitHub Packages publication, or moving-reference compatibility.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/evildarkarchon/jbsa/issues/29/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/evildarkarchon/jbsa/issues/29/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/evildarkarchon/jbsa/issues/54","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/evildarkarchon/jbsa","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/evildarkarchon/jbsa/issues/54/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/evildarkarchon/jbsa/issues/54/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/evildarkarchon/jbsa/issues/54/events","html_url":"https://github.com/evildarkarchon/jbsa/issues/54","id":5333339198,"node_id":"I_kwDOULuKyc8AAAABPeRMPg","number":54,"title":"Complete release provenance, notices, and operator documentation","user":{"login":"evildark